    # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    # 6. BODIES FOR 30_props -- 887 dressing props get a collider, a mass and
    #    a physics material, attached as `over` prims. 30_props.usda itself is
    #    NOT edited; this layer is stronger, so the opinions land on top.
    #    Contact audit: 884 testable against the surface below them, 28 resting
    #    on another prop (stacks, so left alone), 241 floating and 223 sunk,
    #    of which 221 got a Z-ONLY correction (max 248 mm). No X, Y or rotation
    #    is ever overridden -- the composition stays the props agent's.
    #
    #    DELIBERATELY LEFT ALONE, and worth someone's attention:
    #      91 props are off by more than 250 mm. They are standing on geometry
    #      this audit does not model (rack shelves, trestles), or they are
    #      genuinely wrong -- e.g. Cardbox prims authored rotateXYZ (180,0,z)
    #      with a base pivot, which sinks the whole box through the slab, and
    #      Pallets_A1/A3 at rotateXYZ (90,0,z) sunk ~1 m. Those are 30_props
    #      bugs and this layer will not paper over them silently.
    #      152 props are tipped or canted. An oriented bounding box is only a
    #      lower bound for a tipped cylinder, so correcting them off a box
    #      test would be guessing. They are audited and reported, never moved.
    # ---------------------------------------------------------------------

    # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    # 7. STATIC COLLIDERS - 2527 prims in 10_terrain and 20_architecture,
    #    authored here as `over` prims so neither of those files is touched.
    #    boundingCube:77  convexDecomposition:525  convexHull:745  none:1180
    #    127 prims deliberately have NO collider (glass shards, barbed wire,
    #    water surfaces, ground decals, light fittings, rebar whiskers).
    # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
        over "Architecture"
        {
            over "ConveyorBridge"
            {
                over "ChordHiE" (
                    prepend apiSchemas = ["PhysicsCollisionAPI", "PhysicsMeshCollisionAPI", "MaterialBindingAPI"]
                )
                {
                    bool physics:collisionEnabled = 1
                    uniform token physics:approximation = "none"
                    rel physics:simulationOwner = </World/PhysicsScene>
                    rel material:binding:physics = </World/PhysicsMaterials/PM_SteelWet>
